speechtext:
I have another amendment, which will be section 11 of the bill. It is:
That paragraph (c) of subsection 1 of section 777 of the act is repealed and the following substituted therefor:
(c) In the provinces of British Columbia, Prince Edward Island, Manitoba, Saskatchewan, Alberta, and in the Northwest Territories and the Yukon Territory and the cities of Saint John, Fredericton and Moncton in the province of New Brunswick where any person is charged with an offence mentioned in any of the paragraphs of section seven hundred and seventy-three, except paragraph (h);
